{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタバレになっちゃうんで\n乃木どこ見たかたは読んでください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表とゆーことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndシングル選抜メンバーに\n選んでいただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらに、七福神に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んで、もっと言うと1列目に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、不安だらけです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるカーの七福神落ちたときは\nやっぱ悔しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前のことだけど\n雑誌も取材も番組も\nうちが七福神だったときは\nあんまり無かったのに\nぐるカーの七福神は全然違って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また七福神になりたいって考えても\nやっぱ無理かな、とか思ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちなんかが\nって考えてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに応援してもらってる\nって知ってるから\nそんなふうには思わないようにしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達や家族とかの身内も\n今、乃木どこ見ていっぱいメールくれてたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも\n握手会で話したこととか\nブログのコメントとか\nファンレとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも知らないところで\n応援してくれてるんですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッピーMusicのロケで\n乃木神社に行った時\n絵馬をたまたま見てたんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合格祈願や合格とか書いてる間に\nうちの事を応援してくれる内容が\n書いてありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンのかたの支えが\n本当に大きいなって改めて思って\n本当に嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖いけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/8712458/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}